   "source": [
    "# 🏛️ LegisSum — BERTScore Evaluation (No Retraining)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Runtime → Change runtime type → T4 GPU** before running!\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook evaluates your pre-trained adapter without retraining:\n",
    "1. Upload your `billsum-lora.zip` adapter (17 MB)\n",
    "2. Load base Mistral-7B once, run base inference\n",
    "3. Apply your adapter, run fine-tuned inference\n",
    "4. Score both with BERTScore\n",
    "\n",
    "**Total time: ~30 min**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── Cell 1: Confirm GPU ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
